    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">IT'S 1949; WORLD WAR II RAGES ON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Europe is on its knees. Deadly Axis Mechs patrol the landscape, intimidating the populace and flushing out rebels. Survivors are few, but have regrouped under the new flag of The Resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the free world\u2019s last hope. Your deadly mission; deliver a devastating EMP weapon into heart of enemy territory to turn the tide of the war. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Grit and Valor - 1949 is coming to PC VR next month! Get ready to command the battlefield in the most immersive way yet.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/08272c54fb18f6a16aa01e924dd52890.poster.avif?t=1754306009\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/08272c54fb18f6a16aa01e924dd52890.webm?t=1754306009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/08272c54fb18f6a16aa01e924dd52890.mp4?t=1754306009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/c9596e22966ae5a522e92f4987065293.avif?t=1754306009\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deploy your Mech Squad and command them in real time to fend off waves of enemies.\u00a0 Each new battlefield presents a new challenge with unique combinations of adversaries and terrain. Think fast to use higher ground and cover, exploit enemy weaknesses, and utilise tactical advantages to withstand the assault, while defending your Command Vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/1618aeb7a7b1e3744bbeb8d82ca9fb79.poster.avif?t=1754306009\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/1618aeb7a7b1e3744bbeb8d82ca9fb79.webm?t=1754306009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/1618aeb7a7b1e3744bbeb8d82ca9fb79.mp4?t=1754306009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/e9c5f1ab5d2c5cde65d911c3d41db849.avif?t=1754306009\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your tactics may be sound, but if you reach the end of your run, you\u2019ll need to make one last stand against a menacing Axis General. These end of Region boss battles will have you facing overwhelming odds, wave upon wave of elite enemies, new hazards, and Kaiju-sized Boss Mechs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/4d7a5b51dc6a09f9f9abf19374c30fd6.poster.avif?t=1754306009\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/4d7a5b51dc6a09f9f9abf19374c30fd6.webm?t=1754306009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/4d7a5b51dc6a09f9f9abf19374c30fd6.mp4?t=1754306009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/cc32d366d18e6904aca406ba5fafc415.avif?t=1754306009\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If your Command Vehicle is destroyed, your Mission is over. Regroup at the Resistance Base, rebuild and upgrade your squad, and redeploy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Scrap and Valor you earn in the field can be used to upgrade Mechs and level up Pilot abilities. But prepare for the unexpected; the battlefields, enemies you face, and any rewards you receive, will never be the same twice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a stand, liberate Europe and free the world. Make this your finest hour!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/4357c900d8f74866744850e04dbd5a23.poster.avif?t=1754306009\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/4357c900d8f74866744850e04dbd5a23.webm?t=1754306009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/4357c900d8f74866744850e04dbd5a23.mp4?t=1754306009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">IT'S 1949; WORLD WAR II RAGES ON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Europe is on its knees. Deadly Axis Mechs patrol the landscape, intimidating the populace and flushing out rebels. Survivors are few, but have regrouped under the new flag of The Resistance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the free world\u2019s last hope. Your deadly mission; deliver a devastating EMP weapon into heart of enemy territory to turn the tide of the war. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Grit and Valor - 1949 is coming to PC VR next month! Get ready to command the battlefield in the most immersive way yet.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/08272c54fb18f6a16aa01e924dd52890.poster.avif?t=1754306009\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/08272c54fb18f6a16aa01e924dd52890.webm?t=1754306009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/08272c54fb18f6a16aa01e924dd52890.mp4?t=1754306009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/c9596e22966ae5a522e92f4987065293.avif?t=1754306009\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deploy your Mech Squad and command them in real time to fend off waves of enemies.\u00a0 Each new battlefield presents a new challenge with unique combinations of adversaries and terrain. Think fast to use higher ground and cover, exploit enemy weaknesses, and utilise tactical advantages to withstand the assault, while defending your Command Vehicle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/1618aeb7a7b1e3744bbeb8d82ca9fb79.poster.avif?t=1754306009\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/1618aeb7a7b1e3744bbeb8d82ca9fb79.webm?t=1754306009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/1618aeb7a7b1e3744bbeb8d82ca9fb79.mp4?t=1754306009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/e9c5f1ab5d2c5cde65d911c3d41db849.avif?t=1754306009\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your tactics may be sound, but if you reach the end of your run, you\u2019ll need to make one last stand against a menacing Axis General. These end of Region boss battles will have you facing overwhelming odds, wave upon wave of elite enemies, new hazards, and Kaiju-sized Boss Mechs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/4d7a5b51dc6a09f9f9abf19374c30fd6.poster.avif?t=1754306009\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/4d7a5b51dc6a09f9f9abf19374c30fd6.webm?t=1754306009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/4d7a5b51dc6a09f9f9abf19374c30fd6.mp4?t=1754306009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/cc32d366d18e6904aca406ba5fafc415.avif?t=1754306009\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If your Command Vehicle is destroyed, your Mission is over. Regroup at the Resistance Base, rebuild and upgrade your squad, and redeploy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Scrap and Valor you earn in the field can be used to upgrade Mechs and level up Pilot abilities. But prepare for the unexpected; the battlefields, enemies you face, and any rewards you receive, will never be the same twice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take a stand, liberate Europe and free the world. Make this your finest hour!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/4357c900d8f74866744850e04dbd5a23.poster.avif?t=1754306009\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/4357c900d8f74866744850e04dbd5a23.webm?t=1754306009\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1911860/extras/4357c900d8f74866744850e04dbd5a23.mp4?t=1754306009\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "A dieselpunk real-time tactics roguelite set in an alt-history World War 2. Grit and Valor \u2013 1949 puts you in command of an elite Mech Squadron. Think fast and battle the Evil Axis forces to liberate Europe. Upgrade your Mechs and Pilots and develop new strategies to neutralise the enemy HQ!",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Polish, Russian, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cGrit and Valor - 1949 offers a strong combination of alt-history universe and real-time tactics\u201d<br>8.5/10 \u2013 Softpedia<br><br>\u201cI can see this being a mainstay of my late-night gaming sessions for the foreseeable future\u201d<br>4/5 \u2013 The Gamer<br><br>\u201cCombat is snappy and engaging, a full run ends in under an hour, and the boss fights are multi-phase slobberknockers...\u201d<br>74% \u2013 PC Gamer<br>",
